    "detailed_description": "<strong>Explore miniature worlds depicting different cultures throughout human history:</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2082690/extras/d4a2adab2f2f3ee44a62deca0498566b.poster.avif?t=1732243202\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2082690/extras/d4a2adab2f2f3ee44a62deca0498566b.webm?t=1732243202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2082690/extras/d4a2adab2f2f3ee44a62deca0498566b.mp4?t=1732243202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Find characters, objects and stories about our ancestors and learn about their lives:</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2082690/extras/a6069d208c8e4bbd08a413dcef86b9ca.poster.avif?t=1732243202\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2082690/extras/a6069d208c8e4bbd08a413dcef86b9ca.webm?t=1732243202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2082690/extras/a6069d208c8e4bbd08a413dcef86b9ca.mp4?t=1732243202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Unlock new worlds and progress through time:</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2082690/extras/39120685065bad1a2694598cbfb6a1c6.avif?t=1732243202\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2082690/extras/3f462b734dc5dbb035b04c9e5bb743ea.avif?t=1732243202\" /></div><br><br>The Human Story is a relaxing, colorful hidden object game in which you explore historically accurate miniature worlds. The game is capturing a big picture view of how human societies and cultures evolved over time from the very first humans in the Old Stone Age until the present day. <br><br>I am a solo dev with a big curiosity for history and creating this game is my way of making sense of the world we are living in today. <br><br><strong>In the first release I am focusing on the Old Stone Age, the New Stone Age and the Bronze Age. Later ages will come with future updates. </strong>",
