ore historically accurate miniature worlds. The game is capturing a big picture view of how human societies and cultures evolved over time from the very first humans in the Old Stone Age until the present day. <br><br>I am a solo dev with a big curiosity for history and creating this game is my way of making sense of the world we are living in today. <br><br><strong>In the first release I am focusing on the Old Stone Age, the New Stone Age and the Bronze Age. Later ages will come with future updates. </strong>",
